# Google Play Dew pricing

The owner approved this rule on 2026-10-28:

- The 10 Dew pack costs the node's current Monero value plus 20%, rounded up
  to a clean regional price.
- Larger packs retain their premiums: 100 Dew at 15%, 500 Dew at 10%,
  1,000 Dew at 5%, and 5,000 Dew at the base value.
- Display savings per Dew against the actual 10 Dew Play price in the same
  currency. Round percentages down. Show no saving for missing, invalid,
  mixed-currency or non-discounted prices.
- Provisioning only the new 10 Dew product leaves existing prices unchanged.
